    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d392">

                <pb facs="0809" n="787" xml:id="pg787"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">684A.85/3–850: Circular telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Certain Diplomatic and
                        Consular Offices </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d392-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-03-08T03:00:00-05:00">March 8, 1950—3 a.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p> Emb Tel Aviv reports high Israeli official disturbed by recent Reuters report
                    that Syrian PriMin has declared his Govt is considering closing Syrian frontiers
                    with Jordan if 5-year agreement Jordan-Israel becomes effective, and that other
                    Arab Govts now conferring on what action to take if this agreement reached.
                    Comment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d392-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d392-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to Damascus; repeated to Beirut, Baghdad, Cairo, and Jidda.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
